  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SFG - Water security study, 2009-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SFG, Water security study, 2009-2011 - Water security, SFG study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studien ska t&#xe4;cka in vattnets roll b&#xe5;de n&#xe4;r det g&#xe4;ller                fattigdomsbek&#xe4;mpning och f&#xf6;r att undvika att konflikter uppst&#xe5;r pga   begr&#xe4;nsade vattenresurser. Studien ska ta fram f&#xf6;rslag till regionala l&#xf6;sningar och lyfta f&#xf6;rdelarna med regionala samarbeten f&#xf6;r att l&#xf6;sa  vattenfr&#xe5;gan i regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The study focuses on transboundary water issues both for poverty      reduction and conflict prevention purposes. The study will suggest    regional solutions and the awareness and viability of regional        cooperative development projects to the problem of water scarcity.</narrative>
  </description>
